          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mwaka wa ĩkũmi na nyanya wa kũsumbĩka kwake, yĩla waminĩte kũthesya ĩ nthĩ na nyũmba, atũma Savani mwana wa Asaliia, na Maaseia ngavana wa ndũa, na Yoa mwana wa Yoaasi mũandĩki wa maũndũ, matũngĩĩe nyũmba ya Yeova Ngai wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.22.3+2KI.22.4+2KI.22.5+2KI.22.6+2KI.22.7+2KI.22.8+2KI.22.9+2KI.22.10+2KI.22.11+2KI.22.12+2KI.22.13+2KI.22.14+2KI.22.15+2KI.22.16+2KI.22.17+2KI.22.18+2KI.22.19+2KI.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 22.3–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mooka kwa Ilikia mũthembi mũnene, na manengane mbesa ila syaetiwe nyũmbanĩ ya Ngai, ila Alivai, asũvĩi ma myalyonĩ, maĩ manoomban’ya kuma kw’okonĩ kwa Manase na Evalaimu, na kuma kwa ũtialo w’onthe wa Isilaeli, na kwa onthe ma Yuta na Mbenyamini, na kwa ala matwĩe Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.35.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mav 35.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mainengane mokonĩ ma athũkũmi ala masiasya nyũmba ya Yeova; na athũkũmi ala matethasya wĩa nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova mainengane sya kũseũvya na kũtũngĩĩa nyũmba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mainenga aseũvya ma mbwaũ na aki nao, mathooe mavia masũvye, na mĩtĩ ya ũkwatan’ya, na ya mĩamba ya nyũmba ila asumbĩ ma Yuta maanangĩte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na andũ asu matethasya wĩa na kĩthito: na asyaĩĩsya moo maĩ Yaathi na Ovatia, Alivai, ma ana ma Melali; na Nzekalia na Mesulamu, ma ana ma Akoathi, ma kũtwaĩĩa wĩa na mbee; na angĩ ma Alivai, onthe ala maĩ ma ũtũĩka wa kũinga syĩndũ sya kũinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O na maĩ asyaĩĩsya ma ala makuaa mĩio, na matwaĩa na mbee onthe ala matethasya wĩa wa kĩla mũthemba wa ũthũkũmi: na ma Alivai kwaĩ aandĩki, na anene, na asũvĩi ma mĩomonĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla maumisye mbesa ila syaetiwe nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova, mũthembi Ilikia oona ĩvuku ya mĩao ya Yeova, ĩla yanenganiwe nĩ Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ilikia asũngĩa amwĩa mũandĩki Savani, Nĩnoona yĩla ĩvuku ya mĩao nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova. Na Ilikia amũnenga Savani yĩla ĩvuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Savani amũtwaĩa mũsumbĩ ĩvuku, o na ĩngĩ amũtũngĩa mũsumbĩ ũvoo, akĩmwĩa, W’onthe ũla wameaĩe athũkũmi maku nĩmekwĩka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nĩmatulũlĩte mbesa ila syoonekie nyũmbanĩ ya Yeova, na mainenganĩte kw’okonĩ kwa asyaĩĩsya, na kw’okonĩ kwa athũkũmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũandĩki Savani amũtavya mũsumbĩ, akĩmwĩa, Mũthembi Ilikia nũnengete ĩvuku. Na Savani ayĩsomea mbee wa mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla mũsumbĩ waminie kwĩw’a ndeto sya mĩao, atembũanga ngũa syake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ eeaĩa Ilikia, na Aikamu mwana wa Savani, na Avitoni mwana wa Mika, na mũandĩki Savani, na Asaia mũthũkũmi wa mũsumbĩ, akĩmea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.26.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yel 26.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endai, mũkakũlye Yeova kwondũ wakwa, na kwondũ wa ala matialile ma Isilaeli na Yuta, ũndũ wa ndeto sya ĩvuku yĩla yonekete; nũndũ ũthilĩku wa Yeova nĩ mũnene ũla ũtwonoesye, nĩkwĩthĩwa aaĩthe maitũ matyaasũvĩa ndeto ya Yeova, makeka kwĩanana na w’onthe ũla ũandĩkĩtwe ĩvukunĩ yĩĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Ilikia, na ala meeaĩwe nĩ mũsumbĩ, maenda kwa mwathani Ulita kĩveti kya Salumu mwana wa Tokathi, mwana wa Asala, mũsũvĩi wa ngũa (nake atwĩe Yelusaleme ũtũinĩ wa kelĩ); na maneena nake ũu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amea, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova, Ngai wa Isilaeli, ũnũkwasya: Mũtavyei mũndũ ũla ũmũtũmie kwakwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Sisya, ngaetee vandũ vaa ũthũku, na andũ ala matwĩe vaa, o iumo syonthe ila iandĩkĩtwe ĩvukunĩ yĩla manasomee mbee wa mũsumbĩ wa Yuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
